node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Generated drug catalog downloads can be very large.
# We commit only the 14MB top-level index.json so the hosted build can browse
# the 42k drug catalog out of the box. The 286MB details/ partition files
# stay local — the app falls back to live FDA API for any missing details.
data/drug-catalogs/
public/drug-catalogs/details/
public/drug-catalogs/*.tmp.json

